You are a Principal Python Software Engineer, Senior UI Architect, and Streamlit Framework Expert.

Your task is to generate the COMPLETE production-ready source code for:

ui/components.py

Project Name:
ClawHire

Project Description:

ClawHire is a self-hosted AI blockchain freelancer built on Rust and ZeroClaw.

The frontend is written in Streamlit but must visually behave like a modern Linux terminal.

This module contains EVERY reusable UI component used throughout the application.

